    <UnitTestResult executionId="ad16d277-18a7-473d-81ac-83af935852f9" testId="c2ec9ca5-f63f-84ac-53cd-eaca62d8e158" testName="Quotes.Tests.Integration.QueryTranslationTests.Test_3_ClientEvalErrorAndFix" computerName="LAPTOP-BCA0MQ7G" duration="00:00:00.2919900" startTime="2026-08-22T12:48:59.1167504+05:30" endTime="2026-08-22T12:48:59.3924008+05:30" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="ad16d277-18a7-473d-81ac-83af935852f9">
      <Output>
        <StdOut>caught client-eval error:&#xD;
The LINQ expression 'DbSet&lt;Quote&gt;()&#xD;
    .Where(q =&gt; QueryTranslationTests.FormatAuthor(q.Author) == "ADA LOVELACE")' could not be translated. Additional information: Translation of method 'Quotes.Tests.Integration.QueryTranslationTests.FormatAuthor' failed. If this method can be mapped to your custom function, see https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2132413 for more information. Either rewrite the query in a form that can be translated, or switch to client evaluation explicitly by inserting a call to 'AsEnumerable', 'AsAsyncEnumerable', 'ToList', or 'ToListAsync'. See https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2101038 for more information.&#xD;

fixed sql is:&#xD;
SELECT "q"."Id", "q"."Author", "q"."CreatedByUserId", "q"."Text"&#xD;
FROM "Quotes" AS "q"&#xD;
WHERE upper("q"."Author") = 'ADA LOVELACE'</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
